# Copied into the release as .gitignore. Everything kit writes in this folder stays out of git: runs and caches
# (work/, including the unpacked VC3D AppImage), the experiment ledger (experiments/), downloaded models
# (checkpoints/), scroll data and maps, the Python environment and VC3D downloads. The patterns that start with /
# hold for this folder wherever it sits, also inside another repository.
/work/
/experiments/*
!/experiments/README.md
/checkpoints/
/predictions/
/volume-cache/
/ink-dataset/
*.zarr/
*.tifxyz/
*.tif
*.tiff
*.npy
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
/build/
/dist/
squashfs-root/
*.AppImage
*.AppImage.part
*.dmg
